For this buildup, I chose a cowl induction hood, to[ give][ my] 454SS[ a] look that dates back[ to] it's[ muscle] car heritage in the SS Camaros, Chevelles, and the[ like], and to keep it smooth and clean. Some other hotrodders might prefer a[ later]-[model] Cam[aro]-style ram-air hood. Others might[ find] they[ need] a hood scoop to clear some air cleaner assemblies. It is nothing more[ than] the preference of the buyer.
