Re: Where is the mail stored in the filesystem?[
]Found using[ forum] search feature.[
][Christian] is correct[.] It is stored[ in] a mysql database. Xtrabackup[ (]Percona.com) for live incremental backups or mysq[ld]ump to backup just the email. By default mysql is setup for one big file instead[ of] table[ per] file[.]
Use the[ ssh] connection method with your regular user name.
password[ is] stored[ in] /var/lib/zentyal/conf/sa-[mys]ql.pass[wd].
