there are a few corrections to[ what] folks have said on[ here].
The mail[ isn]'t actually stored in the My[S]ql z[ar]afa db. I loaded around 8000 mail[ items] into the zarafa and it didn't significatnly affect the[ size] of[ the] database.[
]The[ mail][ and] also the zarafa-search indexes (if enabled) are actually stored[ in] the[ file][ sy]stm under /var/lib/zarafa.
